{"musicId":420,"duration":136.881633,"vocalId":958,"assetbundle":null,"format":"lrc","lrc":"[ti:imaginary love story]\n[re:One selected game origin; supplied source instances retained]\n[00:10.162]A princess trapped inside a castle\n[00:15.458]Waiting for the one to come rescue me\n[00:20.947]These building blocks connect me and you\n[00:26.467]To build a bridge that goes straight to your heart\n[00:31.555]Open this door to a magical world\n[00:36.037]To a place where surprises await\n[00:41.948]Hey hey jump to the sky\n[00:44.524]Hey hey shoot for the stars\n[00:47.204]Will you play along with me\n[00:49.988]Won't you join me in my fantasy\n[00:53.069]Hey hey let's play pretend\n[00:55.572]Hey hey until the end\n[00:58.214]In my future diary\n[01:00.907]Together we can write our imaginary love story\n[01:04.154]Stuck in a maze that I can't escape\n[01:09.802]Won't you become my light in the dark\n[01:15.234]I'm a puzzle with one missing piece\n[01:20.666]The only one that can solve it is you\n[01:25.538]Somehow we've become two main characters\n[01:30.090]Of a brand new untold fairy tale\n[01:35.984]Hey hey let's run away\n[01:38.588]Hey hey just for today\n[01:41.454]You're the reason I can sing\n[01:44.006]Only you can be my everything\n[01:47.188]With you with you I'm not alone\n[01:49.388]With you with you be my hero\n[01:52.114]Will you save the world with me\n[01:54.676]So that we can write our imaginary love story\n","translationLrc":"[ti:imaginary love story]\n[re:Original project Chinese; line timing only]\n[00:10.162]被困在城堡之中的公主\n[00:15.458]正在静静等待能将我拯救的命中注定之人\n[00:20.947]这些积木将你与我紧紧相连\n[00:26.467]搭建起一座径直通往你内心的桥梁\n[00:31.555]敞开这扇通往魔法世界的大门\n[00:36.037]前往那满载惊喜等待着我们的天地\n[00:41.948]嘿！ 嘿！ 嘿！ 嘿！ 跃向天际吧！\n[00:44.524]嘿！ 嘿！ 嘿！ 嘿！ 追逐繁星吧！\n[00:47.204]你愿意与我一同游戏吗？\n[00:49.988]你不愿加入我的奇幻遐想吗？\n[00:53.069]嘿！ 嘿！ 嘿！ 嘿！ 一起过家家吧！\n[00:55.572]嘿！ 嘿！ 嘿！ 嘿！ 直到世界的尽头！\n[00:58.214]在我未来的日记本里\n[01:00.907]我们能一同谱写属于我们的幻想恋爱故事\n[01:04.154]困在无法逃离的迷宫之中\n[01:09.802]你愿意成为照亮我黑暗的微光吗？\n[01:15.234]我是一幅缺少了一块拼图的残局\n[01:20.666]唯一能够将它拼凑完整的唯有你\n[01:25.538]不知不觉间 我们成为了两位主角\n[01:30.090]演绎着一部全新而未曾言说的童话\n[01:35.984]嘿！ 嘿！ 嘿！ 嘿！ 一起私奔逃跑吧！\n[01:38.588]嘿！ 嘿！ 嘿！ 嘿！ 就仅限今天这一天！\n[01:41.454]你是我能够放声歌唱的全部意义\n[01:44.006]唯有你能够成为我的全部\n[01:47.188]有你！ 伴我！ 有你！ 伴我！ 我不再孤单！\n[01:49.388]你愿意！ 你愿意！ 成为我的英雄吗！\n[01:52.114]你愿意与我一同拯救这个世界吗？\n[01:54.676]这样我们就能一同谱写属于我们的幻想恋爱故事\n","wordLines":[{"start":10.162,"text":"A princess trapped inside a castle","end":15.458,"words":[{"from":0,"to":1,"start":10.16225,"end":10.45825},{"from":2,"to":10,"start":10.45825,"end":10.90725},{"from":11,"to":18,"start":10.90725,"end":11.23525},{"from":19,"to":25,"start":11.46925,"end":11.73925},{"from":26,"to":27,"start":11.73925,"end":12.00325},{"from":28,"to":34,"start":12.00325,"end":12.97925}],"cueStart":10.162},{"start":15.458,"text":"Waiting for the one to come rescue me","end":20.947,"words":[{"from":0,"to":7,"start":15.45825,"end":15.75525},{"from":8,"to":11,"start":15.75525,"end":16.01925},{"from":12,"to":15,"start":16.01925,"end":16.28425},{"from":16,"to":19,"start":16.28425,"end":16.62025},{"from":20,"to":22,"start":16.82225,"end":17.13125},{"from":23,"to":27,"start":17.13125,"end":17.40325},{"from":28,"to":34,"start":17.40325,"end":17.75525},{"from":35,"to":37,"start":17.75525,"end":18.59525}],"cueStart":15.458},{"start":20.947,"text":"These building blocks connect me and you","end":26.467,"words":[{"from":0,"to":5,"start":20.94725,"end":21.24425},{"from":6,"to":14,"start":21.24425,"end":21.56425},{"from":15,"to":21,"start":21.56425,"end":21.94025},{"from":22,"to":29,"start":22.52425,"end":22.86825},{"from":30,"to":32,"start":22.86825,"end":23.19525},{"from":33,"to":36,"start":23.19525,"end":23.99625},{"from":37,"to":40,"start":23.99625,"end":24.49125}],"cueStart":20.947},{"start":26.467,"text":"To build a bridge that goes straight to your heart","end":31.555,"words":[{"from":0,"to":2,"start":26.46725,"end":26.89125},{"from":3,"to":8,"start":26.89125,"end":27.25925},{"from":9,"to":10,"start":27.25925,"end":27.579